            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at 47 Station",
            "review_text": "Ginny H\n1 contribution\n0\nBeautiful and good drinks\nJul 2017\nI went to this cafe with a group of friends and kind of fell in love with it. The owner is really friendly and also speaks quite good English. We had lots of fun with all the games, there's heaps of them. The drinks are really good and reasonably priced, the mango and passion fruit juice is to die for! Definitely recommend it for anyone who wants to find a place to chill out and use some good wifi when you come to Buon Ma Thuot.\nRead more\nWritten July 12, 2017",
            "rating": 2.0,
