            "review_title": "Review at 47 Station",
            "review_text": "Tuan Anh Nguyen\nBuon Ma Thuot, Vietnam80 contributions\n0\nPefect, Beautiful space, delicious drinks.\nJun 2017 • Couples\nThe space is beautiful. I think Loc is a professional furniture designer. When I came in, Loc and his sister talked to me. Space bar for coffee, internet, and a few other drinks, generally cheap. Also I am really impressed, the innkeeper can speak good english. An ideal place to relax and study\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 1, 2017",
