            "review_title": "Review at 47 Station",
            "review_text": "Nathan Moore\n9 contributions\n0\nA hidden Gem in Buon Ma Thuot\nJul 2017 • Couples\nMy wife and I visited this cafe while we were in BMT. We searched new cafes and found this, it was a bit of a ride from the centre but well worth the effort. Try the Italian sodas and fresh fruit smoothies, they're amazing! I was talking to the owners, a brother and sister, they both speak English, the sister speaks perfect English. I spent a few hours using the wifi here for work and I can recommend it for that.\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2017",
